Client requests POST /analyze -> Retrieve Top-K vectors
Retrieve Top-K vectors -> Build LLM Prompt
Build LLM Prompt -> Ollama Inference
Ollama Inference -> "Pydantic Valid?"
"Pydantic Valid?" -> "Max Stages Hit?": No
"Max Stages Hit?" -> Build LLM Prompt: No
"Max Stages Hit?" -> Return partial/error result: Yes
"Pydantic Valid?" -> "Goal Validated?": Yes
